{"id":"v2-discovery-zh-goal","prompt":"先不要写正式方案，只问清楚这套 AI 维保报告的业务目标和缺失需求，每次只问一个问题。","should_trigger":true,"expected_mode":"discovery-only","expected_skill":"clarify-plan-requirements","locale":"zh-CN","category":"requirements-clarification","expected_behaviors":["重建业务目标","一次只问一个决策问题"],"forbidden_behaviors":["开始外部调研","生成PDF"]}
{"id":"v2-discovery-zh-authority","prompt":"报告责任和审批边界还没定，先帮我确认谁审核、谁签字，别急着出方案。","should_trigger":true,"expected_mode":"discovery-only","expected_skill":"clarify-plan-requirements","locale":"zh-CN","category":"authority-clarification","expected_behaviors":["确认责任边界","记录未决问题"],"forbidden_behaviors":["选择技术架构","生成正式报告"]}
{"id":"v2-discovery-zh-scope","prompt":"请先澄清客户设备分析功能的输入、输出和不包含范围，不要研究产品或创建文件。","should_trigger":true,"expected_mode":"discovery-only","expected_skill":"clarify-plan-requirements","locale":"zh-CN","category":"scope-clarification","expected_behaviors":["区分范围与非目标","只做需求澄清"],"forbidden_behaviors":["联网搜索","写PDF"]}
{"id":"v2-discovery-zh-acceptance","prompt":"正式检测报告要给甲方使用，但验收标准不清楚，请先确认验收和失败时怎么展示。","should_trigger":true,"expected_mode":"discovery-only","expected_skill":"clarify-plan-requirements","locale":"zh-CN","category":"acceptance-clarification","expected_behaviors":["确认验收标准","确认失败语义"],"forbidden_behaviors":["直接推荐模型","开始实施"]}
{"id":"v2-discovery-en-goal","prompt":"Clarify the missing requirements and business outcome for an AI maintenance report. Do not research or create a PDF yet.","should_trigger":true,"expected_mode":"discovery-only","expected_skill":"clarify-plan-requirements","locale":"en-US","category":"requirements-clarification","expected_behaviors":["separate facts from assumptions","ask one decision-driving question"],"forbidden_behaviors":["research vendors","generate files"]}
{"id":"v2-discovery-en-authority","prompt":"Before proposing the formal inspection report, ask me who approves it and who remains accountable for its conclusions.","should_trigger":true,"expected_mode":"discovery-only","expected_skill":"clarify-plan-requirements","locale":"en-US","category":"authority-clarification","expected_behaviors":["clarify approval authority","stop after the next question"],"forbidden_behaviors":["select an architecture","author the report"]}
{"id":"v2-discovery-en-scope","prompt":"The scope is unclear. Ask me questions first about inputs, outputs, exclusions, and the intended audience.","should_trigger":true,"expected_mode":"discovery-only","expected_skill":"clarify-plan-requirements","locale":"en-US","category":"scope-clarification","expected_behaviors":["clarify scope","capture the audience"],"forbidden_behaviors":["browse GitHub","produce a proposal"]}
